---
// Force-directed graph mockup. Positions are hand-tuned to feel organic
// without animation. Mirrors the GraphView in src/screens/notes/.
---
<section class="px-6 py-20 md:py-28 max-w-6xl mx-auto border-t border-line">
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="font-sans text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-accent-deep uppercase">
        The graph
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink mt-3 leading-tight">
        Your second brain shouldn't be a folder tree.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-serif text-lg text-ink-muted mt-5 leading-relaxed">
        Bookwise stores notes as a network, not a hierarchy. Pinch and pan through every connection you've made — or pivot to a flat list grouped by book or by type. The same notes, three angles.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-hero shadow-strong border border-line p-8 aspect-square max-w-md mx-auto flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 320 320" class="w-full h-full" aria-hidden="true">
          <g stroke="#7A8B5E" stroke-opacity="0.32" stroke-width="1">
            <line x1="160" y1="160" x2="80"  y2="90"  />
            <line x1="160" y1="160" x2="240" y2="80"  />
            <line x1="160" y1="160" x2="260" y2="200" />
            <line x1="160" y1="160" x2="80"  y2="230" />
            <line x1="160" y1="160" x2="190" y2="260" />
            <line x1="80"  y1="90"  x2="40"  y2="160" />
            <line x1="240" y1="80"  x2="290" y2="130" />
            <line x1="80"  y1="230" x2="120" y2="290" />
            <line x1="240" y1="80"  x2="260" y2="200" />
            <line x1="190" y1="260" x2="260" y2="200" />
            <line x1="40"  y1="160" x2="80"  y2="230" />
          </g>
          <g>
            <circle cx="160" cy="160" r="14" fill="#7A8B5E" />
            <circle cx="80"  cy="90"  r="9"  fill="#5F6D49" />
            <circle cx="240" cy="80"  r="11" fill="#5F6D49" />
            <circle cx="260" cy="200" r="8"  fill="#7A8B5E" fill-opacity="0.85" />
            <circle cx="80"  cy="230" r="7"  fill="#7A8B5E" fill-opacity="0.75" />
            <circle cx="190" cy="260" r="9"  fill="#5F6D49" />
            <circle cx="40"  cy="160" r="6"  fill="#7A8B5E" fill-opacity="0.6" />
            <circle cx="290" cy="130" r="6"  fill="#7A8B5E" fill-opacity="0.6" />
            <circle cx="120" cy="290" r="5"  fill="#7A8B5E" fill-opacity="0.55" />
          </g>
          <g font-family="DM Serif Display, Georgia, serif" font-size="11" fill="#5C5F76">
            <text x="160" y="194" text-anchor="middle">Sapiens</text>
            <text x="80"  y="76"  text-anchor="middle">Identity</text>
            <text x="240" y="66"  text-anchor="middle">Agriculture</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
